<<PlayBackgroundMusic Exciting_1>>
<<SetBGSprite KohliwadaGround>>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Captain.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Bhai? Your turn?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Our turn—Sunil broke his ankle, we need a substitute.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: A… substitute? Me?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: You—I asked, they said yes, today you belong.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: I'm eight.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: And you're Raju—eight is a number, heart is a decision.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Face up, chin up.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Teaching">>
Ramu: Good—remember our five: eyes, feet, hands, timing, temper.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: Will they laugh?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Teaching">>
Ramu: Maybe—people laugh before they clap, let them finish both.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: What do I do first?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Teaching">>
Ramu: First, be seen—walk to the captain, say "Substitute reporting," and let the ground learn your name.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Raju—reporting.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Warm">>
Ramu: One last thing—this isn't magic, it's a memory.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Anxious">>
Raju: I'm scared.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Confident">>
Ramu: Good—fear is proof you're at the door, courage is turning the handle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I'm ready.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Proud">>
Ramu: Then go—touch the ground, touch your heart, and let the evening remember you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Raju—reporting.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Warm">>
Ramu: Play well.

